This repo mirrors nested AGENTS.md and RELEASE_NOTES.md files to Nexus, not just the root.

See ~/codeSync/aistar/docs/agents-md-split-plan.md (Stage 1 engine, Stage 5 per-repo rollout).
Removing this file makes the mirror read only the root AGENTS.md again -- and it DELETES every
nested point from Qdrant when it does, so do not remove it casually.
